# Learn more https://docs.github.com/en/get-started/getting-started-with-git/ignoring-files

# dependencies
node_modules/
# This app is an npm workspace: the ROOT package-lock.json is the only
# authoritative one (CI runs `npm ci` at the repo root). A lockfile written
# here by a stray `npm install` inside the app pins a whole second dependency
# tree -- it went stale on an old Expo SDK once already.
package-lock.json

# Expo
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
expo-env.d.ts

